  "summary": "RPO LS5 454 V-8: Quadrajet carburetor, fuel pump on the front of the block with the fuel pipe up to the carb, the electric choke/heat choke assembly on the intake manifold, the vacuum (spark) solenoid on a bracket under an intake manifold stud, and the spark (vacuum advance) pipes and hoses. Fuel pump bolts to the block with a gasket; the solenoid bracket is held by a production nut and lock washer; the choke is held by a production screw and its rod is retained at the carb lever by a retainer.",
